OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo hits UK with wind and
OL,4,Arain as warnings issued for large parts
OL,5,Aof country
OL,6,
OL,7,FNational Grid says it has restored
OL,8,Fpower to over 117,000 homes since Storm
OL,9,FAusten took hold on Friday, but
OL,10,Fthousands of others are still waiting
OL,11,Fto be reconnected
